For 64 bit to work, the use of 'int' to define the dimensions for a
numpy array has to be changed, because 64-bit numpy needs 64 bit
integers for the dimensions.  I've attached a patch against current
SVN to do this.  Would you consider merging this to fix this problem?

Thanks a lot,

Matthew

